{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_07_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_07","title":"何以忘却","storyCode":"IS-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"b9bd00b6e9168e702258a31a6daac7daca329027efff0637cd5891f39aa2201b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最不起眼的食品安全部......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人缘但不被重视的食品安全部部长......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，卡拉奇这样，为了各大家族之间的平衡而被推选出来的人已经不再需要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您需要一个安全而又好用的傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥部长，真正安全而又好用的傀儡，从来不会这么自称。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是比其他人多一些自知之明而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好一个自知之明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥，如你所说，你确实是替代卡拉奇的最好人选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，既然你如此坦诚，那我也不妨告诉你一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您请说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇，是我的人杀的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很有勇气，我不讨厌和你这样的人聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我可以给你一个机会，卢比奥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走出这间房间，忘记你刚才说过的话，这样的话，你不会受到任何伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，回去和你的妻子还有女儿团聚，好好享受这座城市最后的一点安宁时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样，您难道不是更加需要一个我这样的傀儡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想要的，正是眼下的混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想要推翻西西里夫人定下的秩序，然而，西西里夫人治下也好，更早的时期也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族之间的斗争，从来与普通人无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当一切发生时，我们只能等待一个结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从这个角度来说，是西西里夫人统领这个国家，还是您统领这个国家，对我们普通人来说毫无分别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，最后的胜利者，却总是需要一个统领表面秩序的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您作为一个家族的领袖，想必是明白这个道理的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普通人离开家族并非无法生存，但家族离开普通人，却未必如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说，你们才是强者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是一些弱者的自圆其说罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好一个自圆其说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不能解释你真正的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"权力，尊敬的贝纳尔多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从小就因为这副长相和孱弱的体格，被身边的人看不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，来自身边的人的压迫，比来自家族的还要直接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一路隐忍到现在，就是为了等这一个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您说是您杀了卡拉奇，我只觉得，我这一次来对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说句您不爱听的，您想对抗西西里夫人，我觉得，您很难获胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这又有什么关系呢，我不在乎您到最后能不能赢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这份权力，西西里夫人给不了我，只有您能给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很诚实，卢比奥，我喜欢和诚实的人交朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领......（耳语）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传下命令，就说，今天到此为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才怎么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的房间......好像震了一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，她选择了你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这股震动，是乔万娜的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们决裂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，德克萨斯从窗户跳出去了，我们快跟上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，德克萨斯，如果，我是说如果，当年我们成了朋友，是不是，我就能把你留在叙拉古呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，不可能吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只会互相厮杀至死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅小姐，不要逼我......杀了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有我的任务要完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅小姐，下辈子，希望你不要出生在叙拉古。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......萨卢佐家族的杀手吧？这场行动......已经结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多先生在刚才已经下令了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅，你不该出现在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你妨碍了萨卢佐家族的行动，这会破坏我们两个家族之间的关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，不妨用我的头颅去向阿尔贝托请罪，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等，贝纳尔多先生......不，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一个不情之请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必莱昂图索少爷接下来也会十分繁忙，要他像之前协助卡拉奇那样协助我，恐怕是不现实的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正想要向您要一个新的助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐显然是一个十分合适的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也确实是个办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，瞧我，拉维妮娅小姐，把您晾在一边擅自就把话题进行下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在刚才，贝纳尔多阁下决定，由鄙人，前食品安全部部长卢比奥，接替卡拉奇的位置，成为下一任的建设部部长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我必须诚实地说，我在政府相关事务方面并没有足够的经验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我希望富有经验的您，来成为我的助手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不知道空她们的状况如何......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么，你......您会在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人老了，总是想找个地方享享清福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！她在那！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"包围她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，您是不打算让路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为当年的事，她还是颇为担心你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢，年纪大了，如今爱做的，也不过是关照一下年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下陪我这个老头子聊聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......下次一定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可颂？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，让我瞧瞧，是谁在这里孤军奋战啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么你们都来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"根据我的观察，叙拉古家族的企业文化应该是——打群架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我们企鹅物流的企业文化则是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"派对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个场合，应该是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从不怕群架，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"完全正确！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，老爷爷，看在我们是同族的分上，不能放我们一马吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说蠢话了，能天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一定的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，叙拉古的雨季也确实漫长了些，年轻的时候没有感觉，如今，关节炎也是个烦恼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人们，争强好胜不是坏事，但也要注意身体健康。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，不是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，如果我想和您聊天的话，该去哪里找您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你寻找救赎，那我无计可施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你寻找秩序，那我无处不在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了，让我们离开这里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"状况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝洛内的人撤退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她杀不了我，我也杀不了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该回去准备一下了，贝洛内不会善罢甘休的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你赢了，莱昂图索。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","background